amily:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;margin-left:0.0pt;'>&#183;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Vapores y Calentadores Delta, S.A. de C.V.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;margin-top:5.05pt;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='ANOTACION'> <span style='font-family:Times;'>INDICE</span><br> </div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>0.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Introducci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>1.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Objetivo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>2.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Campo de aplicaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>3.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Referencias</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Definiciones</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.1</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Agua fr&iacute;a</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> &nbsp;</div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;page-break-before:avoid;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.2</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua de almacenamiento</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.4</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua instant&aacute;neo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.5</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua de r&aacute;pida recuperaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.6</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador dom&eacute;stico</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.7</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador comercial</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.8</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calor</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.9</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calor absorbido</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.10</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calor liberado</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.11</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>C&aacute;mara de combusti&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.12</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Capacidad t&eacute;rmica espec&iacute;fica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.13</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Capacidad volum&eacute;trica (calentador de almacenamiento)</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.14</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Carga t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.15</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Combustible</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.16</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Combusti&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.17</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Condiciones ISO</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.18</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Control de temperatura (termostato)</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.19</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Difusor</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.20</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Eficiencia t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.21</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Piloto</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.22</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Poder calor&iacute;fico inferior</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.23</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Poder calor&iacute;fico superior</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.24</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Quemador</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='INCISO'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.25</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Serpent&iacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>5.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>S&iacute;mbolos y abreviaturas</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>6.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Clasificaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>6.1</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>De acuerdo a su carga t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>6.2</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>De acuerdo a su funcionamiento</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>7.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Especificaciones</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>7.1</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Eficiencia t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>7.2</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Temperatura de agua caliente</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>8.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Muestreo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>M&eacute;todos de prueba</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.1</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Fundamento del m&eacute;todo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.2</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparatos y equipo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentadores dom&eacute;sticos y comerciales de almacenamiento</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.4</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentadores dom&eacute;sticos y comerciales de r&aacute;pida recuperaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.5</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentadores dom&eacute;sticos y comerciales instant&aacute;neos</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;page-break-before:avoid;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.6</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>M&eacute;todo de c&aacute;lculo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>10.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Marcado</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>11.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Etiquetado</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>11.1</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Permanencia</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>11.2</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Ubicaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>11.3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Informaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>11.4</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Dimensiones</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>11.5</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Distribuci&oacute;n de la informaci&oacute;n y colores</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:61.2pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>11.6</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Distribuci&oacute;n de los colores</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>12.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Vigilancia</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>13.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Bibliograf&iacute;a</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>14.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Concordancia con normas internacionales</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-21.6pt;' class='ROMANOS'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>15.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Transitorios</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>0. Introducci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>La elaboraci&oacute;n de la presente Norma Oficial Mexicana, responde a la necesidad de incrementar el ahorro</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>de energ&iacute;a y la preservaci&oacute;n de recursos energ&eacute;ticos; adem&aacute;s de proteger al consumidor de productos de</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>menor calidad que pudieran ingresar al mercado nacional.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>1. Objetivo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Esta Norma Oficial Mexicana establece los niveles m&iacute;nimos de eficiencia t&eacute;rmica que deben cumplir los</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>calentadores de agua para uso dom&eacute;stico y comercial y el m&eacute;todo de prueba que debe aplicarse para</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>verificarlos.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Establece adem&aacute;s los requisitos m&iacute;nimos para informaci&oacute;n al p&uacute;blico sobre los valores de eficiencia</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>t&eacute;rmica de estos aparatos.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>2. Campo de aplicaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Esta Norma Oficial Mexicana se aplica a los calentadores de agua para uso dom&eacute;stico y comercial, que se</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>comercializan en los Estados Unidos Mexicanos, que utilicen gas licuado de petr&oacute;leo o gas natural como</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>combustible y que proporcionen &uacute;nicamente agua caliente en fase l&iacute;quida.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Los aparatos para calentamiento de agua con una carga t&eacute;rmica mayor de 108,0 kW y presiones</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>absolutas m&aacute;ximas de trabajo de 600,0 kPa y temperaturas superiores a 360,15 K (87,0&#186;C) son considerados</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>como calderas y no est&aacute;n comprendidos dentro del campo de aplicaci&oacute;n de esta Norma Oficial Mexicana.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>3. Referencias</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>La presente Norma Oficial Mexicana se complementa con la siguiente norma vigente o la que la sustituya:</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>NOM-008-SCFI-2002</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Sistema general de unidades de medida.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4. Definiciones</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Para efectos de la presente Norma Oficial Mexicana se establecen las definiciones siguientes:</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.1 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Agua fr&iacute;a</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Agua de alimentaci&oacute;n al calentador que proviene de una fuente com&uacute;n de abastecimiento.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.2 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparato o equipo que est&aacute; dise&ntilde;ado para calentar agua. Cuenta con una c&aacute;mara de combusti&oacute;n, un</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>cambiador de calor, un quemador y un piloto. Utiliza como combustible gas L.P. o gas natural, y puede tener</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>un control de temperatura autom&aacute;tico (termostato), control de encendido por presi&oacute;n, con aislamiento t&eacute;rmico.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.3 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua de almacenamiento</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;page-break-before:avoid;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparato para calentar el agua contenida en un dep&oacute;sito de almacenamiento.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.4 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua instant&aacute;neo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparato para calentar agua de manera continua a una temperatura uniforme al paso del agua</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>por un</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>serpent&iacute;n.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.5 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de agua de r&aacute;pida recuperaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparato para calentar agua de manera continua a una temperatura uniforme, al paso del agua por uno o</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>m&aacute;s intercambiadores de calor.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.6 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador dom&eacute;stico</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparato para calentar agua con carga t&eacute;rmica m&aacute;xima de 35,0 kW.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.7 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador comercial</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparato para calentar agua con carga t&eacute;rmica mayor de 35,0 kW hasta 108,0 kW.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.8 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calor</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Energ&iacute;a t&eacute;rmica en transici&oacute;n, transferida de un cuerpo o sistema a otro, a trav&eacute;s de sus l&iacute;mites, debido a</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>una diferencia de temperatura entre ellos.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.9 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calor absorbido</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Cantidad de calor aprovechado por el agua.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.10 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calor liberado</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Cantidad de calor proveniente de la combusti&oacute;n.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.11 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>C&aacute;mara de combusti&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Espacio del calentador en donde se lleva a cabo la combusti&oacute;n.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.12 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Capacidad t&eacute;rmica espec&iacute;fica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Cantidad de calor necesaria para elevarle a una unidad de masa de cualquier sustancia un grado de</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>temperatura.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.13 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Capacidad volum&eacute;trica (calentador de almacenamiento)</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Cantidad de agua que el calentador es capaz de almacenar en su dep&oacute;sito, expresada en litros.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.14 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Carga t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Cantidad de calor que absorbe una determinada masa de agua en el calentador, para elevar su</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>temperatura en un cierto intervalo.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.15 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Combustible</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Material capaz de oxidarse r&aacute;pidamente liberando energ&iacute;a en forma de calor y luz.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.16 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Combusti&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Reacci&oacute;n de oxidaci&oacute;n r&aacute;pida de un combustible durante la cual se producen calor y luz como</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>productos</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>principales.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.17 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Condiciones ISO</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Condiciones de referencia aceptadas internacionalmente</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Presi&oacute;n: </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>P = 101,325 kPa</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Temperatura: </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>T = 288,65 K (15,5&#176;C)</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.18 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Control de temperatura (termostato)</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Dispositivo de control para abrir o cerrar el suministro de combustible al quemador, dependiendo de la</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>temperatura del agua.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;page-break-before:avoid;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.19 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Difusor</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Dispositivo que asegura y retarda la salida de los gases producidos por la combusti&oacute;n, evitando un tiro</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>inverso y el exceso de tiro de la chimenea.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.20 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Eficiencia t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Es la relaci&oacute;n existente entre el calor absorbido por el agua y el calor liberado por el combustible,</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>expresado en por ciento.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.21 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Piloto</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Dispositivo donde se produce una flama peque&ntilde;a que se utiliza para encender el quemador.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.22 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Poder calor&iacute;fico inferior</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Es la diferencia entre el poder calor&iacute;fico superior y la energ&iacute;a necesaria para evaporar toda la humedad</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>presente en los gases de combusti&oacute;n residuales.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.23 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Poder calor&iacute;fico superior</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Cantidad de calor que produce una unidad de masa o de volumen de combustible durante su combusti&oacute;n.</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Considerando que la humedad residual presente se encuentra en fase l&iacute;quida.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.24 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Quemador</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Dispositivo que se utiliza para efectuar la mezcla aire-combustible y realizar la combusti&oacute;n, con el fin de</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>aprovechar el calor liberado.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>4.25 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Serpent&iacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Tubo o arreglo de tubos y sus accesorios dentro del cual fluye el agua a calentar, y que se encuentra en</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>contacto con la corriente de gases de combusti&oacute;n.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>5. S&iacute;mbolos y abreviaturas</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'><span style='font-family:Symbol;'>r</span></span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>a</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Densidad del agua (se considera igual a 1000 kg/m</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>cpa</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Capacidad t&eacute;rmica espec&iacute;fica del agua, igual a 4186 J/kg&#176;C para el intervalo de temperatura de</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>270,15 K a 360,15 K (-3 a 87&#176;C).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Ef </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Eficiencia t&eacute;rmica del calentador (%).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Fp </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Factor de correcci&oacute;n por presi&oacute;n (adimensional).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Ft </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Factor de correcci&oacute;n por temperatura (adimensional).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>i </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>I&eacute;simo componente del gas combustible.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>ma </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Masa del agua (kg).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>n </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>N&uacute;mero de componentes del gas combustible.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Pbar </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Presi&oacute;n barom&eacute;trica del lugar de prueba (Pa).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Pc </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Presi&oacute;n manom&eacute;trica medida en la tuber&iacute;a de alimentaci&oacute;n del gas combustible al calentador (Pa).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>PCI </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Poder calor&iacute;fico del gas combustible a condiciones ISO (J/m</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>PCIi </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Poder calor&iacute;fico del i&eacute;simo componente del gas combustible a condiciones ISO (J/m</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Piso </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Presi&oacute;n a condiciones ISO (101,325 kPa) a la que se reporta el PCIi.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>qma </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Flujo m&aacute;sico del agua (kg/s).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>qvc </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Flujo volum&eacute;trico del gas combustible (m</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>/s).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>T1a </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Temperatura inicial del agua (&#176;C).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>T2a </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Temperatura final del agua (&#176;C).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;page-break-before:avoid;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Tc </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Temperatura medida en la tuber&iacute;a de alimentaci&oacute;n de gas combustible al calentador (K).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Tiso </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Temperatura a condiciones ISO (288,65 K) a la que se reporta el PCIi.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Va </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Volumen de agua calentada (m</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Vc </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Volumen de gas combustible consumido (m</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>3</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>yi </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Fracci&oacute;n molar del i&eacute;simo componente del gas combustible (adimensional).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Instrumentos:</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>FQI</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>=</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Totalizador indicador de flujo.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>PI</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>=</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Indicador de presi&oacute;n.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>PC</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>=</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Regulador de presi&oacute;n.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:39.6pt;text-indent:-25.2pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>TI</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>=</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Indicador de temperatura.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>6. Clasificaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Los calentadores cubiertos por la presente Norma Oficial Mexicana se clasifican de acuerdo a su carga</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>t&eacute;rmica y funcionamiento como sigue:</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>6.1 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>De acuerdo a su carga t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:50.4pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;' class='INCISO'> <span class='listStyle_2070612807_level_1' style='font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;margin-left:0.0pt;'>&#183;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador dom&eacute;stico: cuya carga t&eacute;rmica m&aacute;xima es de 35,0 kW.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:50.4pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;' class='Texto'> <span class='listStyle_98914495_level_1' style='font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;margin-left:0.0pt;'>&#183;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador comercial: cuya carga t&eacute;rmica es mayor de 35,0 kW, hasta 108,0 kW.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>6.2 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>De acuerdo a su funcionamiento</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:50.4pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;' class='Texto'> <span class='listStyle_98914495_level_1' style='font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;margin-left:0.0pt;'>&#183;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de Almacenamiento</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:50.4pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;' class='Texto'> <span class='listStyle_98914495_level_1' style='font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;margin-left:0.0pt;'>&#183;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador de R&aacute;pida recuperaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:50.4pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;' class='Texto'> <span class='listStyle_98914495_level_1' style='font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;margin-left:0.0pt;'>&#183;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Calentador Instant&aacute;neo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>7. Especificaciones</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>7.1 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Eficiencia t&eacute;rmica</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>La eficiencia t&eacute;rmica de los calentadores cubiertos por esta Norma Oficial Mexicana debe ser la indicada</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>en la tabla 1, determinada como se indica en 9.6</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>TABLA 1.- Eficiencia t&eacute;rmica m&iacute;nima para calenta</span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>dores dom&eacute;sticos y comerciales, </span><span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>con base al poder</span><br> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>calor&iacute;fico inferior</span><br> </div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> <table width="100%" style='border-collapse:collapse;'> <tr style='height:16.25pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:329.2pt;' colspan='3'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Eficiencia T&eacute;rmica  (%)</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:31.0pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:145.3pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Tipo</span><br> </div> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>de calentador</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:95.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Volumen (L)</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:87.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Eficiencia</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border-left: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-right: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-top: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:145.3pt;' rowspan='4'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Almacenamiento</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:95.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>1  40</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:87.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>76</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:95.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>+40 - 62</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:87.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>77</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:95.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>+62 - 106</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:87.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>79</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:95.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>+106 - 400</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:87.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>82</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:145.3pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>R&aacute;pida Recuperaci&oacute;n</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:95.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:87.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>82</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:16.25pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:145.3pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Instant&aacute;neo</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:95.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:middle;width:87.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>84</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> </table> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>7.2 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Temperatura de agua caliente</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>La temperatura del agua caliente que se obtiene a la salida de los calentadores de agua para uso</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>dom&eacute;stico o comercial se muestra en la tabla 2.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>TABLA 2.- Temperaturas de agua caliente</span><br> </div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> <table width="100%" style='border-collapse:collapse;'> <tr style='height:26.7pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:67.4pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Calentador</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Funcionamiento</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Temperatura de corte</span><br> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>en &#186;C</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Incremento m&iacute;nimo</span><br> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>de temperatura &#186;C</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border-left: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-right: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-top: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:67.4pt;' rowspan='3'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Dom&eacute;stico</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>Almacenamiento</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>70 &#177; 5 (1)</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='background-color:#c0c0c0;border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>R&aacute;pida Recuperaci&oacute;n</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='background-color:#c0c0c0;border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>25 (2)</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>Instant&aacute;neo</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='background-color:#c0c0c0;border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>25 (2)</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border-left: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-right: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-top: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:67.4pt;' rowspan='4'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Comercial</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>Almacenamiento de baja temperatura</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>70 &#177; 5 (1)</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='background-color:#c0c0c0;border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>Almacenamiento de alta temperatura</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>82 &#177; 5 (1)</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='background-color:#c0c0c0;border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:15.5pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>R&aacute;pida Recuperaci&oacute;n</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='background-color:#c0c0c0;border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>25 (2)</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> <tr style='height:16.25pt;'> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:165.85pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>Instant&aacute;neo</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='background-color:#c0c0c0;border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:99.39pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> </td> <td style='border: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;vertical-align:middle;width:102.95pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;'>25 (2)</span><br> </div> </td> </tr> </table> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>(1) Sin flujo de agua hasta el corte del interruptor(es) por temperatura (termostato).</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>(2) Mayor que el agua de alimentaci&oacute;n.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>8. Muestreo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>De acuerdo con el art&iacute;culo 73 de la Ley Federal sobre Metrolog&iacute;a y Normalizaci&oacute;n, la Secretar&iacute;a de</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Energ&iacute;a, a trav&eacute;s de la Comisi&oacute;n Nacional para el Uso Eficiente de la Energ&iacute;a, establece el procedimiento</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>para la evaluaci&oacute;n de la conformidad correspondiente.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9. M&eacute;todos de prueba</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.1 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Fundamento del m&eacute;todo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>El m&eacute;todo directo de prueba para verificar la eficiencia t&eacute;rmica de los calentadores consiste</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>fundamentalmente en calcular la fracci&oacute;n de la energ&iacute;a liberada por el combustible que es aprovechada por el</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>agua para elevar su temperatura.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>La carga t&eacute;rmica de los calentadores de almacenamiento dom&eacute;sticos y comerciales corresponde al calor</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>necesario para elevar la temperatura del agua contenida en el dep&oacute;sito de almacenamiento hasta el punto de</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>corte de combustible, y para los calentadores de r&aacute;pida recuperaci&oacute;n e instant&aacute;neos de tipo dom&eacute;stico y</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>comercial, es la cantidad de calor necesaria para elevar como m&iacute;nimo 25 grados Kelvin (25&#186;C) la temperatura</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>del agua suministrada al equipo durante su paso por &eacute;ste.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.2 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Aparatos y equipo</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;'>Para realizar la prueba de eficiencia t&eacute;rmica de un calentador de agua para uso dom&eacute;stico o comercial, de</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>acuerdo a su funcionamiento, se debe contar como m&iacute;nimo con la instrumentaci&oacute;n y equipo instalados que se</span><span style='font-family:Arial;'> </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>describen en la tabla 3 y cualesquiera de las tres opciones descritas en la tabla 4.</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-indent:14.4pt;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>9.2.1 </span><span style='font-family:Arial;'>Instrumentaci&oacute;n</span></div> <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;'>TABLA 3.- Instrumentos y equipo para la prueba de eficiencia t&eacute;rmica</span><br> </div>  <div style='margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> &nbsp;</div> <table width="100%" style='border-collapse:collapse;'> <tr style='height:32.44pt;'> <td style='border-left: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-right: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-top: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:top;width:79.35pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Variable</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border-left: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-right: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-top: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:top;width:62.94pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;white-space:;' class='Texto'> <span style='font-family:Arial;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;'>Clave</span><br> </div> </td> <td style='border-left: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-right: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);border-top: 0.75pt solid rgb(0,0,0);padding-left:3.6pt;padding-right:3.6pt;vertical-align:top;width:85.15pt;'> <div style='color:#000000;margin-bottom:5.05pt;margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-ind